      <package fileName="WatermarkFromReference-20260816.zip" sha1="0710fc26ba1ba7c90dcbd4ede5e49ba1d810dddf" type="script" releaseDate="20260816">
         <title>Watermark From Reference</title>
         <description>
            <p>Stamps acquisition metadata (telescope, camera, filter, exposure, date and more) from a reference FITS/XISF file or an open view as a text watermark onto a new copy of a target image, positioned by dragging in a live preview.</p>
         </description>
      </package>
